  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n10000x = (9982)² - (18)²\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a - b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n10000x = (9982)² - (18)²\n\n⇒ 10000x = (9982 - 18)(9982 + 18)\n\n⇒ 10000x = 9964 × 10000\n\n⇒ x = 9964\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option 2.**",
